Harvard CS50 	Week 0 Problem set 0 --- Scratch

----- Stipulations

Your project must use at least two sprites (Bat and Oranges), at least one of which must not be a cat(good).
Your project must have at least three scripts total (i.e., not necessarily three per sprite).
Your project must use at least one conditional, at least one loop, and at least one variable.
Your project must use at least one custom block that you have made yourself (via Make a
Block), which must take at least one input.
-----


Bat controlled by mouse, needs to eat randomly launched oranges, when orange is touched it disappears, keep count at the end display amount eaten.
-----
Bat:

Glides towards mouse at all times, 
Needs outline to know when orange is hit.

Oranges:
